Hermit boys report wailing goddess-like woman --- Vālmīki hastens with arghya to Gaṅgā bank --- Vālmīki welcomes chaste Sītā as daughter-in-law --- Vālmīki attests her sinlessness by penance sight --- Vālmīki promises ascetic women will nurse her --- Sītā bows and follows sage behind --- Women welcome pair and offer service --- Vālmīki entrusts Sītā and returns to ashram